            "created_at": "2025-08-21T22:14:11.782209+00:00",
            "notes": "We are trying to get as much life as possible, so we keep  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) and  [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) because they are cheap easy life add-ons. We add    [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) and  [Reinforced Titanium](item_8ebaa7db-aedf-48ed-adc1-318cb46a3214) because we want the health and the damage reduction.\n\nGet [Iron Eyes](item_f16d03a7-f20e-4a1d-a1f6-55863e163c03) if they have a cas/ashe pocketed by mercy or, in the rare event, moira. \n\n[Abyss Boots](item_cd652839-750f-42b3-a717-04e810db1841) can be an add-on if you have enough for more, or you can get  [Vishkar Condensor](item_086a91da-b65d-4047-8fc7-28a992078b1d) if you have extra cash and feel the need for more shields rather than hp. If they are just destroying you w wp, then get  [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09)  **DO NOT SELL GREEN ITEMS IF YOU CANNOT AFFORD BUY MORE GREEN ITEMS**",
